### Consultar nota emitida (troque pelo links.invoice da solicitação EMITIDA)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/1?series=1
X-Client-Id: cliente-local

### Nota sem alteração (304, troque pelo valor do header ETag da consulta anterior)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/1?series=1
X-Client-Id: cliente-local
If-None-Match: "1-1"

### Nota de outro cliente (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/1?series=1
X-Client-Id: outro-cliente

### Nota inexistente (404 Problem Details)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/999999?series=1
X-Client-Id: cliente-local

### Sem X-Client-Id (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/1?series=1
